Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:06.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then came the stat that redrew the\Ntour maps On January 25th and 26th
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:12.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,2025 BABYMONSTER opened their Hello\NMonsters world tour at the KSPO Dome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:16.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,in Seoul the Olympic gymnastics arena\Nthat functions as K-pop's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:21.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,certification of arrival No girl group\Nhad ever headlined that venue faster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:26.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,They were eight months past debut The\Ntour went on to play thirty-two shows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:31.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,across twenty cities for roughly three\Nhundred thousand people with the Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:35.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,leg alone moving a hundred and fifty\Nthousand tickets at a record pace
